@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8010

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create a case
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/turn
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "case_id": "case_http_001",
  "message": "帮我新建一个发票付款审查 case。",
  "attachments": []
}

### Ask required materials
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/turn
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "case_id": "case_http_001",
  "message": "我现在需要准备什么？",
  "attachments": []
}

### Submit invoice text
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/turn
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "case_id": "case_http_001",
  "message": "这是发票 INV-001，金额 10000 CNY，供应商 ABC。",
  "attachments": []
}

### Submit invoice attachment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cases/case_http_001/attachments
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="01_invoice_INV-2026-001.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ../samples/cases/invoice_payment_case_001/evidence/01_invoice_INV-2026-001.md
--WebAppBoundary--

### Review uploaded attachment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/turn
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "case_id": "case_http_001",
  "message": "请审查我提交的材料文件：01_invoice_INV-2026-001.md",
  "attachments": [
    {
      "name": "01_invoice_INV-2026-001.md",
      "path": "E:\\GPTProject2\\NewERPAgnent\\samples\\cases\\invoice_payment_case_001\\evidence\\01_invoice_INV-2026-001.md",
      "content_type": "text/markdown"
    }
  ]
}

### Generate report
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/agent/turn
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "case_id": "case_http_001",
  "message": "生成报告。",
  "attachments": []
}
